{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":71,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 71:1"},"In thee, O LORD, do I put my trust: let me never be put to confusion. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 71:2"},"Deliver me in thy righteousness, and cause me to escape: incline thine ear unto me, and save me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 71:3"},"Be thou my strong habitation, whereunto I may continually resort: thou hast given commandment to save me; for thou ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["art"]}," my rock and my fortress. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 71:4"},"Deliver me, O my God, out of the hand of the wicked, out of the hand of the unrighteous and cruel man. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 71:5"},"For thou ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["art"]}," my hope, O Lord GOD: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["thou art"]}," my trust from my youth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 71:6"},"By thee have I been holden up from the womb: thou art he that took me out of my mother’s bowels: my praise ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be"]}," continually of thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 71:7"},"I am as a wonder unto many; but thou ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["art"]}," my strong refuge. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 71:8"},"Let my mouth be filled ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["with"]}," thy praise ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and with "]},"thy honour all the day. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 71:9"},"Cast me not off in the time of old age; forsake me not when my strength faileth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 71:10"},"For mine enemies speak against me; and they that lay wait for my soul take counsel together, ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 71:11"},"Saying, God hath forsaken him: persecute and take him; for ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," none to deliver ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["him."]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 71:12"},"O God, be not far from me: O my God, make haste for my help. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:12"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PSA 71:13"},"Let them be confounded ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," consumed that are adversaries to my soul; let them be covered ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["with"]}," reproach and dishonour that seek my hurt. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:13"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PSA 71:14"},"But I will hope continually, and will yet praise thee more and more. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:14"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PSA 71:15"},"My mouth shall shew forth thy righteousness ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," thy salvation all the day; for I know not the numbers ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["thereof."]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:15"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PSA 71:16"},"I will go in the strength of the Lord GOD: I will make mention of thy righteousness, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," of thine only. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:16"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PSA 71:17"},"O God, thou hast taught me from my youth: and hitherto have I declared thy wondrous works. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:17"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PSA 71:18"},"Now also when I am old and greyheaded, O God, forsake me not; until I have shewed thy strength unto ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["this"]}," generation, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," thy power to every one ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," is to come. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:18"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PSA 71:19"},"Thy righteousness also, O God, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," very high, who hast done great things: O God, who ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," like unto thee! ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:19"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PSA 71:20"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Thou,"]}," which hast shewed me great and sore troubles, shalt quicken me again, and shalt bring me up again from the depths of the earth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:20"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PSA 71:21"},"Thou shalt increase my greatness, and comfort me on every side. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:21"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PSA 71:22"},"I will also praise thee with the psaltery, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," thy truth, O my God: unto thee will I sing with the harp, O thou Holy One of Israel. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:22"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PSA 71:23"},"My lips shall greatly rejoice when I sing unto thee; and my soul, which thou hast redeemed. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:23"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PSA 71:24"},"My tongue also shall talk of thy righteousness all the day long: for they are confounded, for they are brought unto shame, that seek my hurt. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 71:24"}]}]}
